Pilot Pen makers of G2, the
go-to pen of "The Kelly Clarkson

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.030
Show" wanna honor

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:43.810
ultimate overachievers, just like y'all.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:44.900
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:45.830
for thousand dollars.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:46.932
That's $500 each is each.

00:02:46.932 --> 00:02:49.476
(Laughing)
(crowd cheering)

00:02:49.476 --> 00:02:50.309
- [Lindsay] Thank you.

00:02:50.309 --> 00:02:51.803
